1
00:00:00,936 --> 00:00:06,146
Alrighty. An 8.2-magnitude
earthquake devastates Pasadena...

2
00:00:06,317 --> 00:00:10,197
(Sheldon:)...reducing mighty edifices to dust,
enguIfing the city in flames...

3
00:00:10,362 --> 00:00:13,862
(Sheldon:)...the streets flow with blood
and echo with the cries of the wounded.

4
00:00:14,033 --> 00:00:17,823
(Sheldon:)Oh, excellent choice.
Now, put on your hard hat and safety vest.

5
00:00:17,995 --> 00:00:21,415
(Leonard:)Oh, fun. I get to spend
another night in front of our apartment...

6
00:00:21,582 --> 00:00:24,462
(Leonard:)...dressed like one of the Village People.

7
00:00:25,628 --> 00:00:30,218
(Sheldon:)You make that joke every three months,
I still don't get it. Leonard, wait.

8
00:00:30,716 --> 00:00:33,806
(Sheldon:)- What are you doing?
- I don't know. What am I doing?

9
00:00:33,969 --> 00:00:38,219
(Sheldon:)Look around you, there's hypothetical
broken glass everywhere.

10
00:00:38,974 --> 00:00:44,774
(Sheldon:)Really? You're going to face Armageddon
without your orthotics? Your choice.

11
00:00:45,356 --> 00:00:48,026
- Uh-oh! Hypothetical aftershock.
- Unh! Aah!

12
00:00:49,527 --> 00:00:52,027
(Sheldon:)And that's why we wear hard hats.

